A missing historical market price prevents daily valuation.

========== API ==========

totalHistory({ accounts: ['*Assets:*'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Other  1 OTHER {1 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK

========== ERROR ==========

No price for OTHER on or before 2024-01-01 can convert it to SEK
